  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Bhagwan Singh Alias Dharmi vs State on 8 December, 2021 Author: Farjand Ali Bench: Farjand Ali",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "[CRLR-1085/2002] Learned counsel for the petitioner though challenged the legality, correctness and propriety of the judgment passed by the courts below, however, at the outset submits that instead of arguing the matter on merit or challenging the conviction, the part of the sentence may be modified to the extent of sentence he has served on the ground that the matter pertains to year 1986 and it was his first offence and has faced the rigour of trial and legal proceedings for 35 years. He submits that the petitioner is a poor milk man and on examination, the seized milk was not found spurious but found adulterated. He submits that the accused has remained in custody in this case for 09 days and now the petitioner has become very old and, therefore, a lenient view may be taken against him. Learned Public Prosecutor has opposed the prayer made by counsel for the petitioner.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "[CRLR-1085/2002] Learned counsel for the petitioner though challenged the legality, correctness and propriety of the judgment passed by the courts below, however, at the outset submits that instead of arguing the matter on merit or challenging the conviction, the part of the sentence may be modified to the extent of sentence he has served on the ground that the matter pertains to year 1986 and it was his first offence and has faced the rigour of trial and legal proceedings for 35 years. He submits that the petitioner is a poor milk man and on examination, the seized milk was not found spurious but found adulterated. He submits that the accused has remained in custody in this case for 09 days and now the petitioner has become very old and, therefore, a lenient view may be taken against him. Learned Public Prosecutor has opposed the prayer made by counsel for the petitioner.",
